                            <comment id="15007973" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 17 Nov 2015 04:05:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user corneadoug commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/440#issuecomment-157262507&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/440#issuecomment-157262507&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

